on exitFrame
  [  0] pushsymb 12 ............................. <#playFile>
  [  2] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  5] getglobal 14 ............................ <tlkpath>
  [  7] getglobal 17 ............................ <optcount>
  [  9] joinstr ................................. <tlkpath & optcount>
  [ 10] pusharglistnoret 3 ...................... <1, tlkpath & optcount>
  [ 12] extcall 13 .............................. sound playFile 1, tlkpath & optcount
  [ 14] ret
end
